---
// The Decap CMS UI lives at /public/admin/index.html. Astro's dev server
// doesn't auto-serve directory indexes from `public/`, so this route makes
// /admin and /admin/ work in `pnpm run dev`.
//
// In production, the static host (Netlify, GitHub Pages, etc.) handles the
// index.html lookup itself, and this file is shadowed by
// /public/admin/index.html. Astro prints a "skipping" warning during build
// to alert us of the conflict — that warning is expected and harmless.
return Astro.redirect("/admin/index.html");
---
